# Normal T1 Arc builds need no build-time OpenAI key or Tarv1s service secret.
# Every user connects their own OpenAI project key from Tarv1s settings; the key
# stays in Android secure storage and must never be added to an environment file.
#
# The disconnected mTLS research variables are documented separately in
# .env.mtls-poc.example. Do not copy them into a normal app build.
